  unitName: Sinister Basilisk Kafka
  unitId: 60766
  unitNumber: 1022
  description: A Summoner selected to join the covert "Ishgria's Recon Squad". When
    the squadron suffered the attack of a terrible beast, Rhoa was prepared to sacrifice
    himself in order to help his comrades escape. However, Kafka saw through his
    plans, and chose to help him against his will. Though it was the first time the
    two of them ever fought together, it is said that they made for a pretty good
    team. However, Kafka's appearance began to change in the middle of the fight,
    for the knowledge she had gained in Bariura had been of demonic origin after
    all.
  summonDesc: Argh... So many things are...<br>Demons are definitely...no joke...<br>Guess
    you reap what you sow...
  fusionDesc: Ugh, this is not going well.<br>Do something about it!<br>Just kidding,
    I'll help too.
  evoDesc: I think I messed up a little...<br>I did become stronger, but at this<br>rate...
    Use me well, okay?
